","correct":false},{"text":"Dar por conocidas todas sus necesidades y experiencias","correct":true},{"text":"Preguntar por barreras concretas","correct":false}],"metadata":{"origin":"original_training","language":"es","source_urls":["https://www.who.int/health-topics/gender"],"verified_at":"2026-10-30","academic_year":1,"content_batch":"es-s1-final-20261030","academic_semester":1,"external_expert_review":"pending"},"topic_id":"d7301030-2026-4000-8001-000000000016","image_url":null,"created_at":"2026-10-30T20:40:10.013424+00:00","difficulty":1,"updated_at":"2026-10-30T20:40:10.013424+00:00","explanation":"Los patrones poblacionales no sustituyen escuchar la experiencia individual.","is_published":true,"source_label":"Entrenamiento original · https://www.who.int/health-topics/gender","display_order":7,"question_text":"¿Qué debe evitarse al conocer que una persona pertenece a un grupo social?","question_type":"mcq","accepted_answers":[],"validation_status":"source_validated"},{"id":"d7301030-2026-4000-8003-000000000158","options":[{"text":"Exclusión de necesidades comunicativas","correct":false},{"text":"Accesibilidad, calidad, aceptabilidad y dignidad","correct":true},{"text":"Mismo recurso sin analizar ninguna barrera","correct":false},{"text":"Trato condicionado a estereotipos","correct":false}],"metadata":{"origin":"original_training","language":"es","source_urls":["https://www.who.int/health-topics/gender"],"verified_at":"2026-10-30","academic_year":1,"content_batch":"es-s1-final-20261030","academic_semester":1,"external_expert_review":"pending"},"topic_id":"d7301030-2026-4000-8001-000000000016","image_url":null,"created_at":"2026-10-30T20:40:10.013424+00:00","difficulty":1,"updated_at":"2026-10-30T20:40:10.013424+00:00","explanation":"La OMS señala que los servicios deben ser accesibles y aceptables y prestarse con calidad, equidad y dignidad.","is_published":true,"source_label":"Entrenamiento original · https://www.who.int/health-topics/gender","display_order":8